     "<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\">Dear all,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\">start the new year by building strong foundations in  <strong>statistics with R</strong>!</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\">Our online course  &quot;Introduction to Statistics in R&quot; will take place on 19–22 January and is designed for complete beginners, combining clear explanations with hands-on practice in R. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif;font-size:medium\">This course will help you read, interpret, and write R scripts, apply key statistical tools to research questions, and perform efficient, reproducible analyses. By the end, you&#39;ll confidently use R for both descriptive and inferential statistics.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"><strong>Only a few seats are still available:  <a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/fmc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" style=\"color:rgb(0,102,204);outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/fmc/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412926148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0es6qd6xowVrACTT5_KQDw\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/fmc/</a> </strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\">Happy New Year everyone!</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\">Best regards,</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\">Carlo</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,times,serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br>Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D<br><br><br>Physalia-courses DIRECTOR<br><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a><br><br>mobile: <a href=\"tel:+49%20176%2045230846\" value=\"+4917645230846\" target=\"_blank\" r